verified empirically against the running app; see Verification.

**What was implemented**

- `pages/player-page.js`: `require` -> `import`,
  `module.exports = class Player` -> `export default class Player`.
  `require('bitfield').default` became `import BitField from
  'bitfield'` (the package sets `__esModule` on its CJS build and has a
