  `require('pkg').default` -> default import.

**Files changed**

- `src/renderer/pages/player-page.js`
- `src/renderer/pages/torrent-list-page.js`
- `src/renderer/pages/AGENTS.md`
- `specs/prd.json`, `progress.log`

**Verification**

- `grep -rn "module\.exports\|require(" src/renderer/pages/` returns no
  hits in any `.js` file -- the whole page layer is ESM. (The only
  matches are prose in `AGENTS.md` and one comment in `app.js`.)
- `npm test` (standard + depcheck) passes, exit 0.
- `npm run build` (Babel) compiles 64 files.
- `npx vite build` succeeds; the bundle contains the unique player-page
