## 2026-07-28 - US-020
- Implemented `src/renderer/lib/platform/ipc-os.js` over `ipcRenderer`.
  Every stub body from US-018 now sends or listens on its real
  channel; the JSDoc surface is unchanged, so `docs/platform-shim.md`
  needed no signature edits. A private `listen(channel, listener,
  options)` helper strips the Electron event object, honours
  `{ once: true }` and returns the unsubscribe closure, so every
  `on*` export resolves to a `() => void`.
  `checkForExternalPlayer` collapses the existing send-then-`once`
  pair into one promise, registering the reply listener before the
