**Interpretation note.** The acceptance criteria say these files' non-`wt-*`
calls should "use `lib/platform/ipc-os.js`", but three channels --
`openPath`, `showItemInFolder`, `moveItemToTrash` -- are owned by
`shell.js` per `lib/platform/AGENTS.md` and the shim doc. They went to
