  - ADR house format (ADR-001..ADR-011): `# ADR-NNN: Title`, then
    `**Date:** YYYY-MM-DD`, then `## Context` (ending with a bulleted
    "Alternatives considered" list, each with its concession), then
    `## Decision`, then `## Consequences` that names the cost rather
    than only the benefit. Prose, not bullet soup, and it cites file
    paths with line numbers. INDEX.md is a markdown table plus a
    "Related documents" list; add the row, do not renumber anything.
