- **Learnings for future iterations:**
  - **Put the engine's Electron import outside `src/renderer/` and the
    boundary lists shrink instead of growing.** The obvious placement
    for the bus was `src/renderer/webtorrent-bus.js`, which would have
    needed a third entry in `eslint-boundary.config.js` and two more in
