    the destination), so the same change *removed* two exemptions.
    Prefer the destination directory over the current one whenever a
    Phase 3 story creates a file that Phase 3 will move anyway.
  - **`globalThis.WEBTORRENT_ANNOUNCE` in the hidden window is the
    cheapest proof that an inbound `wt-*` payload arrived intact.**
    `main.js` sends `wt-set-global-trackers` on every startup and
    `setGlobalTrackers` writes the argument straight to that global, so
    reading it back through `executeJavaScript` distinguishes "payload
    delivered" from "event object delivered" with no patching of the
    engine at all. Key the `did-finish-load` probe on
    `location.pathname` -- both windows fire it.
  - **The `console.dir(e.sender.getTitle())` in the `ipcMain.emit`
