    engine-to-UI messages and `grep -c "'Main Window'"` counts the
    reverse, with no probe code. Any story that changes the engine
    transport can use it as a before/after number.
  - **A handler that only forwards its arguments is worth leaving
    alone.** `bus.on('wt-stop-torrenting', (infoHash) =>
    stopTorrenting(infoHash))` reads like it should collapse to
    `bus.on('wt-stop-torrenting', stopTorrenting)`, but the explicit
