    or deletes `src/main/`.
  - Shim selection is build-time via a Vite `resolveId` plugin keyed on
    `WT_HOST` (default `electron`), rewriting resolutions of
    `lib/platform/<mod>.js` to `lib/platform/tauri/<mod>.js`.
  - Tauri 2; Rust >= 1.77.2; Node >= 20.19 for Vite 8; webkit2gtk-4.1 +
