  - **A `resolve.alias` entry cannot select the shim tree.** Vite
    matches `find` against the import specifier *as written*, and
    `lib/platform/index.js` imports its siblings relatively
    (`'./clipboard'`). An alias list would miss every one of them and
    still build -- a mixed Electron/Tauri bundle. US-052 needs a
    `resolveId` plugin that works on resolved absolute paths, and it
    must leave resolutions already under `tauri/` alone or it recurses.
